Uh, have you seen
the movie <i>Shark Night 3D?</i>


00:32:19.366 --> 00:32:20.699
It's exclusively
about sharks in a lake!


00:32:20.701 --> 00:32:22.167
Just shut up!


00:32:26.172 --> 00:32:28.092
What about you, Johnny?
You've been pretty quiet.


00:32:28.441 --> 00:32:30.943
Sucks.


00:32:30.945 --> 00:32:33.312
You were freaking out when we
all decided to go swimming.


00:32:33.314 --> 00:32:35.180
Is there something about this
lake you're not telling us, hmm?


00:32:35.182 --> 00:32:36.248
No.


00:32:38.451 --> 00:32:40.252
I don't believe you.


00:32:41.287 --> 00:32:42.721
What is this piece
of jewelry you got on?


00:32:42.723 --> 00:32:44.423
MATT: Simon, cool it.


00:32:44.425 --> 00:32:45.557
Tell us what you know, Johnny!


00:32:45.559 --> 00:32:46.725
Nothing, man.


00:32:46.727 --> 00:32:49.161
Answer, or I'm gonna
throw you overboard.


00:32:49.163 --> 00:32:50.923
Look, I didn't think
you'd go swimming, okay?


00:32:52.065 --> 00:32:54.232
What are you saying?
Let him go.


00:32:54.234 --> 00:32:55.600
I didn't think
you'd all go swimming.


00:32:55.602 --> 00:32:57.669
We were just going to
cross the lake and party.


00:32:57.671 --> 00:32:59.237
You knew about that
thing in the water?


00:32:59.239 --> 00:33:00.739
Look, Kitty.
It was just an old folktale


00:33:00.741 --> 00:33:02.307
my grandpa used
to say, all right?


00:33:02.309 --> 00:33:04.242
KITTY: No. No, no, no.
That doesn't add up, Johnny,


00:33:04.244 --> 00:33:06.545
because you tried to
give me that necklace


00:33:06.547 --> 00:33:09.581
to protect me. So,
obviously, you do believe.


00:33:09.583 --> 00:33:11.616
I don't know, Kitty, okay.
I don't know.


00:33:11.618 --> 00:33:13.185
Man, you knew about this
and you brought us out here?


00:33:13.187 --> 00:33:16.288
You let us go
swimming 30 yards out!


00:33:16.290 --> 00:33:18.256
Leave me alone, man, all right?
I didn't want this to happen.


00:33:18.258 --> 00:33:19.458
I didn't know it would happen.


00:33:19.460 --> 00:33:21.026
ZEKE: And cut.


00:33:23.229 --> 00:33:25.764
That was pretty much a confession
as far as I'm concerned.


00:33:25.766 --> 00:33:27.499
So let's do a little, you know,


00:33:27.501 --> 00:33:29.167
rundown of our
situation right here.


00:33:29.169 --> 00:33:31.036
We have zero oars,


00:33:31.038 --> 00:33:32.104
we have a hole in
the side of our boat...


00:33:32.106 --> 00:33:33.305
JOHNNY: Just shut up.


00:33:33.307 --> 00:33:35.007
With water
leaking in, and oh, yeah,


00:33:35.009 --> 00:33:36.675
there's a giant
flesh-eating fish in the water


00:33:36.677 --> 00:33:37.576
that will not let us
get back to shore...


00:33:37.578 --> 00:33:39.511
Point, point, point!


00:33:39.513 --> 00:33:40.479
- ...unless we distract it with
something! - JOHNNY: Shut up.


00:33:40.481 --> 00:33:41.713
Like what?


00:33:42.315 --> 00:33:44.182
Like Deb.


00:33:44.184 --> 00:33:47.019
I'm suggesting we use Deb
as a distraction in the water.


00:33:47.021 --> 00:33:48.387
I think she
would have approved.


00:33:48.389 --> 00:33:49.788
- What? No, that's crazy.
- Is it?


00:33:49.790 --> 00:33:51.723
- SIMON: You're nuts.
- Uh-huh.


00:33:51.725 --> 00:33:54.393
Her mother's Catholic.
She needs a proper burial.


00:33:54.395 --> 00:33:55.527
I went to church
with her as a kid.


00:33:55.529 --> 00:33:57.062
You can't do that.


00:33:57.064 --> 00:33:58.665
Well, that's
irrelevant right now, Kitty.


00:34:00.166 --> 00:34:03.035
Burial at sea is
an honorable way to go.


00:34:03.037 --> 00:34:05.137
She'd be aiding
her friends in need.


00:34:05.139 --> 00:34:07.205
That's gotta be in
the crew code, right?


00:34:07.207 --> 00:34:09.608
Yeah. I think it's the right
thing to do, morally.


00:34:10.410 --> 00:34:11.810
Johnny.


00:34:13.513 --> 00:34:15.647
I don't know, Kitty.
I mean, we can do


00:34:15.649 --> 00:34:17.816
a prayer when we
put her on the side.


00:34:17.818 --> 00:34:24.456
When she goes over, we all paddle like hell
till we get to the other side.


00:34:24.458 --> 00:34:26.124
She saves the whole team.


00:34:28.528 --> 00:34:30.062
Kitty, what do you say?


00:34:34.333 --> 00:34:35.834
- (SNIFFLING) - It's okay, Kitty.
It's the right thing to do.


00:34:35.836 --> 00:34:37.702
ZEKE: Good call, Kitty.


00:34:37.704 --> 00:34:39.404
Let me do this...


00:34:45.111 --> 00:34:46.278
(SOBBING)


00:35:26.719 --> 00:35:30.856
Lord, bless our friend,
Deborah Vorhese,


00:35:31.824 --> 00:35:34.793
who, uh...


00:35:34.795 --> 00:35:40.398
She, uh, gave her life for us,
and we know she's going to a better place


00:35:43.703 --> 00:35:46.805
and by Your
eternal wisdom, we, uh,


00:35:47.773 --> 00:35:50.742
return her to Your side.


00:35:51.577 --> 00:35:53.578
Forever and ever. Amen.


00:36:11.564 --> 00:36:12.931
MATT: Be ready to paddle.


00:36:19.572 --> 00:36:20.539
(SHRIEKS)


00:36:42.695 --> 00:36:44.196
Come on, paddle! Paddle!


00:36:55.541 --> 00:36:57.209
Paddle!


00:36:57.211 --> 00:36:59.477
ZEKE: It's working, guys.
All we needed was a diversion.


00:37:21.434 --> 00:37:24.075
KITTY: Oh, my God. I think it's
working, guys. We're gonna make it.


00:37:40.286 --> 00:37:42.520
ZEKE: Oh, no. Oh, no.
Guys, feeding time's over.


00:37:42.522 --> 00:37:43.622
That fish is done.
It went back under.


00:37:43.624 --> 00:37:45.690
- KITTY: Get your hand out.
- MATT: What?


00:38:02.508 --> 00:38:04.743
We can bail. At least bail.


00:38:14.487 --> 00:38:16.721
Johnny, give me
the lid of that cooler there.


00:38:16.723 --> 00:38:18.423
Move, Zeke, move!


00:38:18.425 --> 00:38:19.758
It's on a hinge, man.


00:38:19.760 --> 00:38:20.892
What?


00:38:23.562 --> 00:38:26.631
- Here.
- Okay.


00:38:26.633 --> 00:38:30.435
All right. Now, everyone bail.
I'm gonna go to the front to paddle. Okay?


00:38:30.437 --> 00:38:31.603
All right, all right.


00:38:31.605 --> 00:38:32.526
Let me go to the front.


00:38:39.979 --> 00:38:43.748
Hey, Zeke, help us, man!


00:38:43.750 --> 00:38:44.783
KITTY: Does anybody see it?


00:38:44.785 --> 00:38:46.484
ZEKE: No.


00:38:46.486 --> 00:38:48.720
All right, all right.
Keep going. Keep going.


00:38:55.695 --> 00:38:56.761
SIMON: This sucks!


00:38:58.030 --> 00:38:59.931
MATT: Keep bailing.


00:38:59.933 --> 00:39:01.766
Matt, what's your problem?
Paddle!


00:39:01.768 --> 00:39:03.001
Matt, paddle!
What is your problem?


00:39:03.003 --> 00:39:04.369
Just paddle!


00:39:06.339 --> 00:39:07.872
(GRUNTING)


00:39:07.874 --> 00:39:09.341
No! No! Are you serious?


00:39:09.343 --> 00:39:10.575
SIMON: Matt.


00:39:10.577 --> 00:39:11.910
Are you serious?


00:39:11.912 --> 00:39:13.378
Matt, take it easy, okay.


00:39:16.849 --> 00:39:18.016
Why is this happening?


00:39:18.851 --> 00:39:20.819
That thing is out to get us.


00:39:20.821 --> 00:39:22.554
Don't take it personally,
Matt. It's just a fish.


00:39:22.556 --> 00:39:23.688
It's one hell of a fish.


00:39:23.690 --> 00:39:24.756
No, it's not, dude!


00:39:24.758 --> 00:39:26.124
It's just some dumb fish, okay?


00:39:26.126 --> 00:39:28.093
The only thing that
thing knows is that


00:39:28.095 --> 00:39:30.695
whatever is in the water,
it's gonna eat.


00:39:30.697 --> 00:39:32.697
So let's see what else
we have in the cooler.


00:39:42.675 --> 00:39:44.576
In the water, not in the boat.


00:39:57.823 --> 00:40:01.059
Come on, what do we have?
Let's bail, let's bail.


00:40:01.061 --> 00:40:02.527
Okay, everybody lean
to this side, all right?


00:40:02.529 --> 00:40:03.762
All right.


00:40:09.869 --> 00:40:11.035
Again.


00:40:11.037 --> 00:40:12.704
This sucks.


00:40:12.706 --> 00:40:14.639
Look, as long as we can see him,
I'm just gonna paddle.


00:40:14.641 --> 00:40:15.840
MATT: Okay.


00:40:59.552 --> 00:41:01.486
Oh, not let that
thing control us!


00:41:08.961 --> 00:41:11.062
ZEKE: Okay, let's face it.
The only thing that worked was


00:41:11.064 --> 00:41:12.530
when it was
preoccupied with Deb's body,


00:41:12.532 --> 00:41:16.901
Well, we don't have any extra dead
bodies on hand, do we, Einstein?


00:41:16.903 --> 00:41:18.203
I know that, okay?


00:41:18.205 --> 00:41:19.737
So,
what, are you volunteering to


00:41:19.739 --> 00:41:21.206
get in the lake to
create a diversion?


00:41:21.208 --> 00:41:22.474
- No.
- Okay, then what's your point?


00:41:22.476 --> 00:41:25.710
Because I'm the weakest one
and you guys all know that.


00:41:25.712 --> 00:41:27.679
I mean, I don't stand a chance
fighting that thing.


00:41:27.681 --> 00:41:29.848
Oh, so, maybe someone
more athletic should do it,


00:41:29.850 --> 00:41:31.616
like my brother, or me?


00:41:31.618 --> 00:41:32.617
No.


00:41:35.855 --> 00:41:39.023
Johnny is the one who got us into
this situation. I'm just saying.


00:41:39.025 --> 00:41:41.259
Shut up. Just all
of you. Just shut up.


00:41:41.261 --> 00:41:43.127
I'm just saying.


00:41:43.129 --> 00:41:44.696
But I think we should vote.


00:41:49.835 --> 00:41:52.537
MATT: Boat's sinking, Kitty.


00:41:52.539 --> 00:41:54.539
We're gonna die
if we do nothing.


00:41:55.140 --> 00:41:56.941
Or we can save some of us.


00:41:58.010 --> 00:42:00.144
We can make some choices.


00:42:00.146 --> 00:42:01.846
We vote on one person to...


00:42:03.582 --> 00:42:05.617
To volunteer for
the sake of the boat.


00:42:05.619 --> 00:42:06.985
KITTY: Come on, Matt.
Cut it out.


00:42:06.987 --> 00:42:08.853
We vote. Now.


00:42:10.523 --> 00:42:12.257
And Johnny, since you're the
one who got us into this,


00:42:12.259 --> 00:42:13.791
who do you think
should go first?


00:42:13.793 --> 00:42:14.926
Go to hell, Matt.


00:42:17.229 --> 00:42:20.198
Hey, Zeke,
why don't you volunteer, huh?


00:42:20.200 --> 00:42:21.666
Oh. No, wait a second.


00:42:21.668 --> 00:42:23.067
No, it was your idea, pal.


00:42:23.069 --> 00:42:24.235
This is how this
thing should work, okay.


00:42:24.237 --> 00:42:25.770
Each of us
should get to make up,


00:42:25.772 --> 00:42:26.771
um, like, a case for ourselves.


00:42:26.773 --> 00:42:28.206
A case?


00:42:28.208 --> 00:42:30.742
Yes, like, a case for why
we should stay on the boat.


00:42:30.744 --> 00:42:32.310
This is insane.


00:42:32.312 --> 00:42:34.812
Kitty, I want to live, okay.
I want us to live.


00:42:34.814 --> 00:42:36.981
The hell with you, Matt.
No, this is not how we do this.


00:42:36.983 --> 00:42:38.783
You know, we stick together!
Don't touch me!


00:42:38.785 --> 00:42:41.686
We should be bailing,
or using something else to row.


00:42:45.624 --> 00:42:47.559
Johnny,
you should have told us!


00:42:47.561 --> 00:42:49.060
You really should have told us!


00:42:49.062 --> 00:42:50.895
Stay away from me, Matt!
Kitty!


00:42:50.897 --> 00:42:52.030
Okay, Matt, okay, okay.
We vote.


00:42:52.032 --> 00:42:53.331
(LOUD THUMP)


00:42:53.966 --> 00:42:55.633
I vote for Zeke.


00:42:55.635 --> 00:42:58.002
No, I get to make
my case first, okay?


00:42:58.004 --> 00:43:00.572
Okay, this has to be quick.
Two sentences.


00:43:00.574 --> 00:43:02.106
Who made you
president of the boat?


00:43:02.108 --> 00:43:04.576
All right, two sentences.
Me first.


00:43:04.578 --> 00:43:07.178
I'm strong, and you need me
to paddle. All right? Matt?


00:43:07.180 --> 00:43:09.540
Yeah, same goes for me. And I'm
stronger than Simon. Johnny?


00:43:13.085 --> 00:43:14.652
Great case, Johnny.


00:43:18.223 --> 00:43:20.692
I mean, I'm gonna do something with
my life. All you guys know that.


00:43:20.694 --> 00:43:21.960
I mean, I'm gonna be
an important filmmaker.


00:43:21.962 --> 00:43:23.761
I'm gonna make things
actually matter to people.


00:43:23.763 --> 00:43:25.663
I mean, things that might
even change the world,


00:43:25.665 --> 00:43:27.332
and I don't mean to be
diminutive to your lives,


00:43:27.334 --> 00:43:29.200
but you're not gonna do
anything as important as that.


00:43:29.202 --> 00:43:30.602
I mean, you're just not.
You're nice people,


00:43:30.604 --> 00:43:33.838
that affect the world like that,
and you all know it.


00:43:33.840 --> 00:43:36.274
Somewhere deep down inside,
all of you know that.


00:43:37.309 --> 00:43:38.843
That's not two sentences.


00:43:40.179 --> 00:43:42.113
Johnny's the one who
got Deb killed. Not me.


00:43:42.115 --> 00:43:44.782
Johnny's the one who got us into
this entire situation, not me!


00:43:44.784 --> 00:43:45.883
(LOUD THUMP)


00:43:48.654 --> 00:43:51.189
(STUTTERING) I'm gonna
be a star or a singer.


00:43:51.191 --> 00:43:58.963
People need that, you know, to
put up with the crap, to deal with their lives.


00:43:58.965 --> 00:44:01.232
Matt, you need that, right?


00:44:01.234 --> 00:44:04.235
Simon does, Johnny does.
Right, Johnny?


00:44:04.237 --> 00:44:05.737
Yeah.


00:44:07.072 --> 00:44:08.339
All right.


00:44:09.942 --> 00:44:11.175
That's it.


00:44:12.177 --> 00:44:14.245
That's all of us. We vote.


00:44:14.980 --> 00:44:16.014
I vote for Zeke.


00:44:19.318 --> 00:44:20.785
I go with Johnny.


00:44:22.688 --> 00:44:24.756
MATT: You? You?


00:44:27.826 --> 00:44:29.427
Zeke.


00:44:29.429 --> 00:44:32.030
Oh, screw you. I mean, obviously,
I'm gonna vote for Johnny.


00:44:34.266 --> 00:44:36.701
Okay,
what do you say, Matt, huh?


00:44:36.703 --> 00:44:39.904
One more and Zeke goes,
and that's...


00:44:39.906 --> 00:44:42.006
That's what I want,
so just do it.


00:44:44.877 --> 00:44:47.211
Johnny's a fighter.


00:44:47.213 --> 00:44:49.280
He's got a chance of getting away.
I vote Johnny.


00:45:02.995 --> 00:45:05.296
You know, I didn't plan
for this to happen, Matt.


00:45:06.865 --> 00:45:08.700
Maybe I should have.


00:45:09.168 --> 00:45:10.835
(SCOFFS)


00:45:10.837 --> 00:45:12.870
You don't deserve her.
Either of you.


00:45:12.872 --> 00:45:14.839
Is that what this is about?
You're a total psycho!


00:45:17.009 --> 00:45:19.177
I'll be back for you, Kitty.
All right? You can count on that.


00:45:19.179 --> 00:45:20.912
It's like High
school's never over.


00:45:20.914 --> 00:45:22.413
You can count on that, Kitty.
I'll be back!


00:45:22.415 --> 00:45:24.749
KITTY: Stop!
Stop! I can't take it.


00:45:24.751 --> 00:45:25.983
Johnny! No! Johnny!


00:45:36.862 --> 00:45:39.130
MATT: Listen, as soon as he
pops up, we're all gonna paddle.


00:45:39.132 --> 00:45:40.164
KITTY: Where...


00:45:41.433 --> 00:45:42.867
Oh, my God! Johnny!


00:45:44.503 --> 00:45:46.204
Oh, look, look, look.
There it is.


00:45:46.206 --> 00:45:47.505
MATT: Come on, paddle!


00:45:47.507 --> 00:45:49.108
ZEKE: It's going after him.
It's working.


00:45:54.880 --> 00:45:56.214
KITTY: OH, my God! Johnny!


00:46:37.990 --> 00:46:39.390
Deb was real.


00:46:40.292 --> 00:46:42.393
Johnny was real.


00:46:42.395 --> 00:46:44.495
They were not like us.
They were better than us.


00:46:44.497 --> 00:46:46.898
ZEKE: Deb got bit by a fish.
End of story. Okay?


00:46:46.900 --> 00:46:49.200
Johnny threw himself over like
a damn martyr. End of story.


00:46:49.202 --> 00:46:52.003
I'm going to kill you!
You're nothing but a selfish prick!


00:46:52.005 --> 00:46:53.404
Oh, well, that wasn't
what you were saying


00:46:53.406 --> 00:46:55.439
when you wanted to lead my movie.
Was it, Kitty?


00:46:55.441 --> 00:46:57.341
God! You're such an asshole!


00:46:57.343 --> 00:46:59.177
Hey!
You guys gotta be kidding!


00:46:59.179 --> 00:47:02.079
Talking about movies now?
Zeke, bail!


00:47:02.081 --> 00:47:04.849
Kitty, paddle! Come on,
while we still have the chance.


00:47:04.851 --> 00:47:06.851
Zeke, if you don't
shut up and paddle


00:47:06.853 --> 00:47:08.293
we might still get
out of this alive.


00:47:11.023 --> 00:47:12.857
KITTY: Oh, God, what if...


00:47:12.859 --> 00:47:15.126
What if we do make it back to shore?
What are we gonna tell people?


00:47:15.128 --> 00:47:17.862
Well, that's is a problem we'd be
lucky to have, okay, sweetheart.


00:47:17.864 --> 00:47:19.597
Your pretty
little head about it


00:47:19.599 --> 00:47:21.532
and leave
the talking to us men.


00:47:21.534 --> 00:47:24.836
You're such an asshole! How can
you keep being such an asshole?


00:47:24.838 --> 00:47:27.338
Keep bailing, you idiot!


00:47:27.340 --> 00:47:30.441
MATT: Now, everyone, come on.
We're all in this together.


00:47:30.443 --> 00:47:32.443
(CHUCKLES) Together.


00:47:32.445 --> 00:47:34.412
Go team.


00:47:34.414 --> 00:47:36.514
I'm sorry, what? What? Hmm?


00:47:36.516 --> 00:47:39.250
You voted against me when you
voted Johnny off the boat.


00:47:39.252 --> 00:47:41.419
Oh, my God. I'm sorry.


00:47:41.421 --> 00:47:44.155
I thought he had a chance that's
all, unlike this little pussy.


00:47:44.157 --> 00:47:45.990
Shut up, Matt!


00:47:45.992 --> 00:47:48.359
Kitty what is with you
and Johnny anyways? Huh?


00:47:48.361 --> 00:47:49.894
You leading him on?


00:47:49.896 --> 00:47:51.596
Got him wrapped
around your little finger?


00:47:51.598 --> 00:47:53.464
That is so out of line, Matt...


00:47:53.466 --> 00:47:55.466
Both of you! Shut up! Come on!


00:48:02.207 --> 00:48:03.941
We need something to fight it.
Anything.


00:48:11.049 --> 00:48:13.417
Guys,
there are fireworks in here!


00:48:13.419 --> 00:48:14.418
ZEKE: These aren't gonna work.
They're wet.


00:48:14.420 --> 00:48:16.320
There are fireworks!


00:48:16.322 --> 00:48:19.423
Here. These are good.
These are good.


00:48:19.425 --> 00:48:21.192
- SIMON: Who has a lighter?
- KITTY: A lighter, a dry lighter?


00:48:21.194 --> 00:48:22.927
MATT: I do. I do. I do.


00:48:24.997 --> 00:48:26.598
- He's back.
- SIMON: I will not take it!


00:48:33.205 --> 00:48:34.505
I'm gonna kill this thing!


00:48:37.009 --> 00:48:38.643
(INDISTINCT SHOUTING)


00:48:40.245 --> 00:48:41.545
Get away.


00:48:41.547 --> 00:48:42.987
MATT: Light this one.
Light this one.


00:48:47.185 --> 00:48:48.653
SIMON: Yeah, more, Kitty!
More!


00:48:51.089 --> 00:48:53.691
KITTY: I don't...
I think that's it.


00:48:53.693 --> 00:48:54.558
SIMON:
Why aren't we getting more?


00:48:54.560 --> 00:48:56.027
MATT: We need more!


00:48:56.029 --> 00:48:57.962
Guys, keep throwing.


00:48:57.964 --> 00:48:59.697
Come on.
Come on. I need another one.


00:48:59.699 --> 00:49:01.365
There aren't any.
That's all of them.


00:49:29.094 --> 00:49:31.562
SIMON: We're sinking.


00:49:31.564 --> 00:49:33.297
We have to do something.
We're not gonna make it this way.


00:49:33.299 --> 00:49:35.232
ZEKE: No, no. Don't say that.
We can't quit now, guys.


00:49:35.234 --> 00:49:37.168
We gotta,
like, keep on paddling.


00:49:38.637 --> 00:49:39.704
Simon?


00:49:41.139 --> 00:49:43.274
We need another distraction.


00:49:43.276 --> 00:49:46.043
ZEKE: Oh! No, no, no, no.
We just need to stay here.


00:49:46.045 --> 00:49:48.546
And something will come up
to save us. Okay?


00:49:48.548 --> 00:49:51.048
We're just... We gotta work
together now. This is the time.


00:49:51.050 --> 00:49:52.350
That's really rich,
coming from you.


00:49:52.352 --> 00:49:54.018
No, I just mean, that...


00:49:54.020 --> 00:49:56.020
Guys, it's coming back.
It's coming.


00:49:57.189 --> 00:50:00.458
ZEKE: Okay, look just...
What's the point here?


00:50:00.460 --> 00:50:02.693
I mean, you saw what it did to
Deb that didn't take long at all.


00:50:02.695 --> 00:50:04.095
That wasn't much
of a distraction.


00:50:04.097 --> 00:50:06.197
And if you get back to shore?


00:50:06.199 --> 00:50:09.100
Right? They're gonna
call you cowards and


00:50:09.102 --> 00:50:11.002
you gonna be ruined for
the rest of your lives.


00:50:11.004 --> 00:50:12.436
So, let's just drop
this whole conversation.


00:50:12.438 --> 00:50:14.038
Your idea in
the first place, jackass.


00:50:14.040 --> 00:50:15.306
KITTY: Zeke can paddle.
Let him paddle!


00:50:15.308 --> 00:50:18.009
Hold on!


00:50:18.011 --> 00:50:19.691
We're not gonna make it.
We're not gonna...


00:50:22.315 --> 00:50:25.483
Okay, let' do it, bro.
It's our only chance! Come on.


00:50:25.485 --> 00:50:28.219
ZEKE: Wait! Wait, wait, wait!


00:50:28.221 --> 00:50:30.621
Matt. Matt, ask her
who else she's been with.


00:50:30.623 --> 00:50:32.723
Ask her. Ask her who
else she's been with!


00:50:32.725 --> 00:50:35.559
Ask her who she's
been with on this boat!


00:50:35.561 --> 00:50:37.161
Ask her!


00:50:37.163 --> 00:50:39.430
Not me, okay. I wouldn't
touch the two-timing slut.


00:50:39.432 --> 00:50:41.198
- Oh, you wouldn't?
- Hey, shut up!


00:50:41.200 --> 00:50:43.701
ZEKE: Ask her who she's been
with on this boat, okay!


00:50:43.703 --> 00:50:45.136
You've no...


00:50:45.138 --> 00:50:46.303
Ask her! Ask him!


00:50:46.305 --> 00:50:47.638
Ask him...


00:50:47.640 --> 00:50:48.539
What's he talking about?


00:50:48.541 --> 00:50:50.174
He's so full of it.


00:50:50.176 --> 00:50:51.375
Zeke's lying!
He's trying to save his ass.


00:50:51.377 --> 00:50:53.110
Nothing.


00:50:53.112 --> 00:50:57.615
I have evidence of that.
I've film everything.


00:50:57.617 --> 00:50:59.617
I got you guys.


00:50:59.619 --> 00:51:01.619
All of your
after-school make outs.


00:51:01.621 --> 00:51:05.156
In the fieldhouse and in the
stadium. I got all of that.


00:51:05.158 --> 00:51:06.724
I heard your little plans.


00:51:06.726 --> 00:51:08.259
I have no idea what
he's talking about.


00:51:08.261 --> 00:51:09.794
They know what
I'm talking about.


00:51:09.796 --> 00:51:11.595
KITTY:
He's lying to save his ass.


00:51:11.597 --> 00:51:13.831
(LAUGHS) Oh, yeah. I'm lying.


00:51:13.833 --> 00:51:16.600
I'm lying.
You're right. I'm lying.


00:51:16.602 --> 00:51:19.070
It's not like, I can't
backup my story in any way.


00:51:19.072 --> 00:51:21.806
Oh, wait a second.
I've film everything!


00:51:21.808 --> 00:51:24.308
I got it, right here, Matt.


00:51:24.310 --> 00:51:28.512
I got all your little cup-cups after school.
I got you in the fieldhouse.


00:51:28.514 --> 00:51:31.315
And at the stadium, I heard
your plans, I heard you talking.


00:51:31.317 --> 00:51:32.817
KITTY: I've no idea
what he's talking about.


00:51:32.819 --> 00:51:34.418
You know exactly
what I'm talking about.


00:51:34.420 --> 00:51:35.486
I was up there in
the announcer's booth...


00:51:35.488 --> 00:51:36.687
You die.


00:51:38.423 --> 00:51:40.357
I vote Zeke.


00:51:40.359 --> 00:51:41.425
Let's do this, bro.


00:51:41.427 --> 00:51:42.593
ZEKE: No! Kitty! Kitty!


00:51:42.595 --> 00:51:43.916
Kitty!
Throw, Kitty, off the boat!


00:51:44.529 --> 00:51:47.131
It should be Kitty!


00:51:47.133 --> 00:51:49.767
Kitty's useless.
She paddles like a girl.


00:51:49.769 --> 00:51:52.870
And she's cheating on
you with your brother.


00:51:52.872 --> 00:51:54.238
That's a valid point.


00:51:54.240 --> 00:51:55.873
ZEKE: Thank you.


00:51:55.875 --> 00:51:57.408
Kitty,
you've to pull your weight.


00:51:57.410 --> 00:51:58.676
Yeah. Yeah.


00:51:59.478 --> 00:52:01.378
But Zeke, Zeke-ster.


00:52:01.380 --> 00:52:03.681
Sorry, you're an irritation.
You always have been.


00:52:03.683 --> 00:52:04.648
You kind of brought in...


00:52:04.650 --> 00:52:05.749
(ZEKE SOBBING)


00:52:05.751 --> 00:52:07.218
No. Matt, no.


00:52:07.220 --> 00:52:08.420
Talking that way about, Kitty.


00:52:08.421 --> 00:52:09.887
- You can't...
- Matt, no.


00:52:10.589 --> 00:52:11.755
No, Matt. No. (SOBBING)


00:52:11.757 --> 00:52:12.857
Let's do it.


00:52:12.859 --> 00:52:14.325
I vote Zeke.


00:52:14.327 --> 00:52:16.360
Zeke.


00:52:16.362 --> 00:52:17.895
ZEKE: Kitty.
Kitty, vote for one of them.


00:52:17.897 --> 00:52:18.762
- Don't vote for me.
- Decide.


00:52:18.764 --> 00:52:20.197
Kitty, vote!


00:52:20.199 --> 00:52:21.565
It'll be a stalemate,
we don't have to


00:52:21.567 --> 00:52:22.867
throw anyone off.
It didn't work.


00:52:22.869 --> 00:52:24.835
- Majority. - We don't
need to vote for anybody.


00:52:24.837 --> 00:52:27.304
I'm sorry.
I'm sorry. I'm sorry. I vote.


00:52:27.306 --> 00:52:28.839
(ZEKE SOBBING)


00:52:34.279 --> 00:52:36.447
No, no, no. No!


00:52:37.182 --> 00:52:38.349
No!


00:52:38.351 --> 00:52:39.683
(GRUNTS)


00:52:42.754 --> 00:52:44.522
(ZEKE YELLING)


00:52:48.693 --> 00:52:50.494
(PANTING)


00:52:56.201 --> 00:52:58.169
No! No!


00:53:00.272 --> 00:53:01.405
No!


00:53:03.241 --> 00:53:04.909
(ZEKE YELLING INDISTINCTLY)


00:53:05.410 --> 00:53:06.744
Simon!


00:53:09.948 --> 00:53:11.782
Matt!


00:53:11.784 --> 00:53:14.218
Matt, they fooled you. Matt!


00:53:15.453 --> 00:53:17.221
They fooled you, Matt!


00:53:18.924 --> 00:53:20.658
They fooled you, Matt!


00:53:21.793 --> 00:53:24.828
How does it feel?
They fooled you.


00:53:25.363 --> 00:53:26.931
(GASPS)


00:53:26.933 --> 00:53:28.566
Row, you heroes.


00:53:29.734 --> 00:53:31.735
Row! Row for your life!


00:53:31.737 --> 00:53:33.304
(LAUGHS MANIACALLY)


00:53:43.815 --> 00:53:45.449
Where are you?


00:53:47.319 --> 00:53:49.220
Where are you, you bitch!


00:53:50.622 --> 00:53:51.989
I'm watching!


00:53:53.291 --> 00:53:54.625
Are you ready?


00:53:55.493 --> 00:53:56.961
Are you ready?


00:54:14.346 --> 00:54:15.446
(MUFFLED SHOUTING)


00:54:23.388 --> 00:54:24.755
(SCREAMING)


00:54:40.872 --> 00:54:42.673
(ZEKE YELLING)


00:54:43.842 --> 00:54:46.010
KITTY: Oh, my God!


00:54:46.012 --> 00:54:47.911
MATT: Paddle!
Kitty, come on. Paddle.


00:54:47.913 --> 00:54:49.913
KITTY: No, no.
Oh, God, make it stop!


00:54:49.915 --> 00:54:51.682
- MATT: Paddle, please.
- KITTY: It's crazy.


00:54:51.684 --> 00:54:52.783
(ZEKE CONTINUES SHOUTING)


00:54:52.785 --> 00:54:54.051
(KITTY SHOUTING INDISTINCTLY)


00:54:54.053 --> 00:54:55.753
MATT: Paddle!


00:54:55.755 --> 00:54:56.987
KITTY: No, I can't.
I'm sorry, I can't.


00:54:56.989 --> 00:54:58.555
(ALL SHOUTING INDISTINCTLY)


00:54:58.557 --> 00:55:00.291
SIMON: Shut up!


00:55:06.665 --> 00:55:07.998
(COUGHING)


00:55:13.438 --> 00:55:14.738
(SPITS)


00:55:58.350 --> 00:55:59.783
KITTY: Matt, I'm your girl.


00:56:02.420 --> 00:56:05.022
She's your girl, Matt.


00:56:05.024 --> 00:56:07.424
Man, are you really gonna
listen to that weasel?


00:56:12.497 --> 00:56:14.131
I don't know. Should I?


00:56:16.835 --> 00:56:18.569
I'm your brother, man.


00:56:20.972 --> 00:56:22.139
Yeah.


00:56:34.819 --> 00:56:36.587
Got to keep bailing.


00:56:37.956 --> 00:56:39.857
Can't believe it, huh?


00:56:41.626 --> 00:56:43.160
Good old Zeke.


00:56:45.463 --> 00:56:48.565
He was my bud,
you know, for a lot of years.


00:56:48.567 --> 00:56:50.067
Ever since what, third grade?


00:56:52.170 --> 00:56:54.838
He really was pretty
handy with that camera.


00:56:54.840 --> 00:56:57.775
I remember he used to
videotape everything.


00:56:57.777 --> 00:57:01.912
He used to video the games for
the coach. Post-game interview.


00:57:01.914 --> 00:57:03.981
"Zeke's post-game interview."


00:57:06.151 --> 00:57:09.119
He said he had wished he had a
camera implanted in his eyeball.


00:57:11.956 --> 00:57:13.490
You know,
he was a pain in the ass, but


00:57:13.492 --> 00:57:14.992
maybe he was gonna
amount to something.


00:57:14.994 --> 00:57:17.494
You know, maybe
he was gonna do something.


00:57:19.697 --> 00:57:22.666
Bro, I know it hurts,
but we did what we had to do.


00:57:25.103 --> 00:57:26.570
MATT: Yeah.


00:57:27.572 --> 00:57:28.739
This day kinda sucks, huh?


00:57:28.741 --> 00:57:30.073
Yeah.


00:57:36.080 --> 00:57:38.782
Stop it. Stop.


00:57:38.784 --> 00:57:40.984
Yup. You know what,
Kitty? You're right.


00:57:40.986 --> 00:57:42.219
Pity party's over.


00:57:44.088 --> 00:57:45.856
Yeah.


00:57:45.858 --> 00:57:47.991
MATT: You checked all
the stuff here? Hmm?


00:57:47.993 --> 00:57:49.993
Anything we don't
need is going over.


00:57:56.167 --> 00:57:57.501
Sorry, Kitty.


00:58:03.475 --> 00:58:05.108
MATT: Hey, whose bag is this?


00:58:06.744 --> 00:58:08.078
SIMON: Guess it's Johnny's.


00:58:09.147 --> 00:58:10.781
What is that? A rubber?


00:58:13.985 --> 00:58:15.085
Wishful thinking.


00:58:19.557 --> 00:58:21.625
- Look at this. Huh?
- Nice.


00:58:21.627 --> 00:58:24.995
Yeah, that thing comes back now
I'm gonna hack it to pieces.


00:58:24.997 --> 00:58:26.163
I'd love to take
a good swipe at it.


00:58:26.165 --> 00:58:27.698
That's right.


00:58:27.700 --> 00:58:29.233
Filet that thing and eat it.


00:58:32.837 --> 00:58:34.271
Simon, bail.


00:58:36.508 --> 00:58:38.041
Aye, aye, Captain.


00:58:39.878 --> 00:58:41.111
Ninja.


00:58:44.215 --> 00:58:46.583
I'm gonna paddle with this.


00:58:47.553 --> 00:58:51.522
Matt, we gotta do something,
we got to get out of here.


00:58:53.658 --> 00:58:55.559
No. No!


00:58:56.127 --> 00:58:59.730
No! Get off! Get off!


00:59:01.699 --> 00:59:02.799
MATT: Let it go.


00:59:02.801 --> 00:59:03.667
KITTY: Simon!


00:59:05.169 --> 00:59:06.537
(GRUNTS)


00:59:08.940 --> 00:59:10.274
(SIMON YELLS)


00:59:14.245 --> 00:59:15.646
MATT: Damn it, Simon.


00:59:15.648 --> 00:59:16.580
(PANTING)


00:59:17.315 --> 00:59:18.715
Sorry.


00:59:32.163 --> 00:59:33.330
SIMON: No, no, no, no, no.


00:59:33.332 --> 00:59:34.631
(WOOD CREAKING)


00:59:36.868 --> 00:59:38.168
(KITTY YELLING)


00:59:43.107 --> 00:59:46.743
Die! Die, you son of a bitch!


00:59:51.749 --> 00:59:54.718
MATT: Whoa! That Kitty
is something, isn't she?


00:59:54.720 --> 00:59:57.988
That's Kitty.
Whoo! That's Kitty.


00:59:57.990 --> 00:59:59.756
SIMON: You kicked it's ass!


00:59:59.758 --> 01:00:01.758
You kicked that thing's ass.


01:00:01.760 --> 01:00:02.893
(WHOOPING)


01:00:04.362 --> 01:00:07.030
That was bad ass, baby. Huh?


01:00:15.006 --> 01:00:16.373
MATT: What?


01:00:18.643 --> 01:00:20.844
We still have to get
back to shore. It's...


01:00:21.613 --> 01:00:22.713
(SIGHS)


01:00:23.081 --> 01:00:24.748
It's so far.


01:00:26.117 --> 01:00:29.119
It will be dark soon. Oh, God.


01:00:32.857 --> 01:00:34.224
(SHUDDERING)


01:00:36.794 --> 01:00:38.629
(ENGINE WHIRRING)


01:00:39.330 --> 01:00:41.231
Wait a minute.


01:00:41.233 --> 01:00:42.799
(WHISPERS) Is that a boat?


01:00:43.935 --> 01:00:45.335
Oh, my God.


01:00:45.337 --> 01:00:47.671
It's a boat.
There's a boat coming!


01:00:47.872 --> 01:00:50.407
Hey! Hey!


01:00:50.409 --> 01:00:51.842
KITTY: God, please. Please.


01:00:51.844 --> 01:00:52.843
MATT: Oh!


01:00:54.178 --> 01:00:56.113
- That's Johnny.
- (SIMON LAUGHS)


01:00:56.115 --> 01:00:58.682
(LAUGHS) He's
coming to save me.


01:00:58.684 --> 01:01:02.085
He said he would come back for me.
He's coming for me.


01:01:02.087 --> 01:01:03.286
KITTY: I'm here, Johnny.


01:01:03.288 --> 01:01:04.855
MATT: Right here, Johnny.


01:01:04.857 --> 01:01:06.056
Johnny-boy!


01:01:06.958 --> 01:01:08.225
Pull her around, Johnny.


01:01:12.330 --> 01:01:14.698
Glad you came back, Johnny.


01:01:15.933 --> 01:01:17.267
What's the plan, hero?


01:01:18.803 --> 01:01:20.070
I'll tow you in.


01:01:20.072 --> 01:01:21.705
Oh, come on. Is that right?


01:01:21.707 --> 01:01:24.307
Why don't you just let us in
the boat with you instead?


01:01:24.309 --> 01:01:26.243
You don't wanna
tow this thing in.


01:01:26.245 --> 01:01:28.211
Because you voted me off, Matt.


01:01:28.213 --> 01:01:30.180
Why wouldn't you
do it again, man?


01:01:30.182 --> 01:01:33.316
Johnny, listen, man.


01:01:33.318 --> 01:01:36.987
We were just trying to
protect the group. That's all.


01:01:36.989 --> 01:01:40.057
I knew you'd make it back safe
and you're here, yes?


01:01:40.059 --> 01:01:42.426
Look, I'll tow you in.
All right? You gonna take it?


01:01:42.428 --> 01:01:46.930
Please, Johnny, I just... I want
to get off this boat. Please?


01:01:46.932 --> 01:01:49.700
Just get him close enough
and I think we can take him.


01:01:50.735 --> 01:01:52.803
Come on.
What's it gonna be, slick?


01:01:52.805 --> 01:01:55.005
Are you gonna come pick us up?
Come get your girl?


01:01:55.007 --> 01:01:57.140
Look at her,
man, she is in distress.


01:01:57.142 --> 01:01:59.776
Look, you want to tow.
I'll throw the rope. All right?


01:01:59.778 --> 01:02:02.145
Otherwise,
Simon, I can go get help.


01:02:02.147 --> 01:02:04.214
But you know that might take
a little bit more time, man.


01:02:04.216 --> 01:02:05.816
Okay, okay.


01:02:05.818 --> 01:02:07.718
Okay, that's cool.


01:02:07.720 --> 01:02:10.754
Sticking to your guns? That's
cool, Johnny. I respect that.


01:02:10.756 --> 01:02:12.189
Toss the rope, then. Come on.


01:02:12.191 --> 01:02:13.757
SIMON: Toss it Johnny-boy!


01:02:15.226 --> 01:02:17.227
Toss the rope.


01:02:17.229 --> 01:02:18.929
Come on, toss it, Johnny-boy.


01:02:18.931 --> 01:02:20.430
It's cool. He's gonna do it.


01:02:20.432 --> 01:02:22.399
Right, Johnny?


01:02:22.401 --> 01:02:23.934
SIMON: Toss it, Johnny-boy.


01:02:23.936 --> 01:02:25.902
MATT: It's cool.
He's gonna do it. Right, Johnny?


01:02:25.904 --> 01:02:28.438
KITTY: Please, please, Johnny.
Let's just go.


01:02:28.440 --> 01:02:31.475
We all do the right thing,
maybe we'll get out of this alive.


01:02:36.748 --> 01:02:37.814
All right.


01:02:42.353 --> 01:02:43.787
KITTY: Thank you.
Thank you, Johnny.


01:02:43.789 --> 01:02:44.988
MATT: That's right.


01:02:50.895 --> 01:02:52.129
Come on.


01:02:54.065 --> 01:02:54.998
Hurry up!


01:03:01.973 --> 01:03:03.874
Come on, man.
Pick it up. Quick, quick.


01:03:12.350 --> 01:03:13.884
(LAUGHS)


01:03:19.257 --> 01:03:20.824
Get it. Get it. Get it.


01:03:23.127 --> 01:03:24.895
All right.
Tie this up. Tie this up.


01:03:32.370 --> 01:03:34.504
- Got it?
- MATT: Got it.


01:03:34.506 --> 01:03:36.306
SIMON:
Don't worry, we're too heavy.


01:03:36.308 --> 01:03:39.109
He'll have to take us on board
when he figures that out.


01:03:40.211 --> 01:03:41.578
Nice, Johnny.


01:03:43.314 --> 01:03:44.815
(ENGINE REVVING)


01:03:53.224 --> 01:03:54.558
(KITTY SCREAMS)


01:04:06.904 --> 01:04:07.904
Oh, my...


01:04:09.073 --> 01:04:10.574
Oh, my God. His neck!


01:04:13.277 --> 01:04:14.344
Cut the rope! Cut the rope!


01:04:14.346 --> 01:04:15.545
We'll lose the motor boat.


01:04:15.547 --> 01:04:17.280
- He's choking, God damn!
- No!


01:04:17.282 --> 01:04:18.348
You cut that
rope I'll kill you.


01:04:18.350 --> 01:04:20.050
Oh, my God! Johnny!


01:04:20.052 --> 01:04:21.017
(GASPING)


01:04:23.554 --> 01:04:25.055
Matt, get off!


01:04:25.057 --> 01:04:28.491
Don't let her cut down!
Don't let her cut down!


01:04:28.493 --> 01:04:31.528
MATT: She won't do it.
That's what I love about Kitty.


01:04:33.631 --> 01:04:35.632
Always out for number one.
Huh?


01:04:36.634 --> 01:04:38.435
- Shut up.
- MATT: Tough as nails.


01:04:53.918 --> 01:04:55.218
I got that, Kitty.


01:04:57.121 --> 01:04:58.655
(MOTOR HUMMING)


01:05:07.031 --> 01:05:09.099
Kitty, get out of the way.
Get to the back.


01:05:14.505 --> 01:05:15.939
MATT: (GRUNTS) We're so close.


01:05:19.010 --> 01:05:20.443
Ah. We're close.


01:05:21.612 --> 01:05:23.213
Come on.


01:05:25.449 --> 01:05:27.250
Get up there and grab it.


01:05:34.625 --> 01:05:36.293
- Damn it!
- No!


01:05:36.295 --> 01:05:37.460
Come on!


01:06:08.459 --> 01:06:09.726
(MOTOR WHIRRING)


01:06:11.362 --> 01:06:13.063
(SIMON GRUNTING)


01:06:13.065 --> 01:06:14.331
Come on!


01:06:20.604 --> 01:06:22.706
No. No!


01:06:22.708 --> 01:06:24.574
Are you kidding me!


01:06:26.344 --> 01:06:27.744
(KITTY WHIMPERING)


01:06:35.086 --> 01:06:37.020
Unbelievable!


01:06:37.022 --> 01:06:38.555
(ECHOES)


01:06:55.406 --> 01:06:57.307
MATT:
All right, here it comes.


01:06:57.309 --> 01:06:58.641
Coming for Johnny.


01:06:59.710 --> 01:07:01.277
- Everyone ready? Huh?
- Yeah.


01:07:01.279 --> 01:07:02.512
Anyone ready to quit?


01:07:02.514 --> 01:07:04.080
Okay, okay, yeah.


01:07:04.749 --> 01:07:06.216
Which way are we going?


01:07:06.218 --> 01:07:07.217
We gonna go forward.


01:07:08.352 --> 01:07:11.788
What? What is it doing?


01:07:11.790 --> 01:07:13.723
What, it's just
gonna leave him there?


01:07:15.259 --> 01:07:16.693
What?


01:07:19.096 --> 01:07:20.196
(LAUGHS)


01:07:20.431 --> 01:07:21.765
What?


01:07:26.537 --> 01:07:27.771
No.


01:07:31.442 --> 01:07:32.308
(SCREAMS)


01:07:37.348 --> 01:07:38.715
(GRUNTS)


01:07:44.422 --> 01:07:46.089
It's working.


01:08:05.376 --> 01:08:06.609
Nice. Nice.


01:08:10.481 --> 01:08:12.315
All right. Let's bail.


01:08:48.686 --> 01:08:51.588
MATT: "They fooled you."


01:08:51.590 --> 01:08:53.590
That's what Zeke said.
You remember Zeke, right?


01:08:53.592 --> 01:08:55.892
Seems like an eternity
since Zeke was here,


01:08:55.894 --> 01:08:58.161
telling me things
I shouldn't hear.


01:09:04.135 --> 01:09:06.236
That side looks closer.
Are we even


01:09:06.238 --> 01:09:08.304
paddling in
the right direction?


01:09:08.306 --> 01:09:11.374
It's a lake. Every
direction leads to the shore.


01:09:11.376 --> 01:09:14.677
KITTY: Not if we're
going in circles, genius.


01:09:14.679 --> 01:09:17.247
MATT: So what did
happen in the fieldhouse?


01:09:21.352 --> 01:09:22.585
Answer me.


01:09:23.554 --> 01:09:24.888
KITTY: Damn it, Matt!


01:09:25.789 --> 01:09:27.624
Zeke was your buddy, right?


01:09:27.626 --> 01:09:31.828
Yeah. You were the big guy who
didn't treat him like a dog turd.


01:09:31.830 --> 01:09:33.863
He was loyal to you.


01:09:33.865 --> 01:09:36.399
If he found out something
he could use against me,


01:09:36.401 --> 01:09:37.901
why wouldn't he have told you?


01:09:37.903 --> 01:09:40.236
If he had like
a video or something.


01:09:40.238 --> 01:09:42.572
But there was nothing, he was
just making it up to save his ass


01:09:42.574 --> 01:09:44.641
when he thought we
were all turning on him.


01:09:46.510 --> 01:09:48.178
Well, I don't know, Kitty.
Maybe, Zeke didn't tell me


01:09:48.180 --> 01:09:49.913
'cause he knew it would
piss me off, you know?


01:09:49.915 --> 01:09:52.649
Matt, don't do this. Not now.


01:09:52.651 --> 01:09:54.684
MATT:
Maybe Simon will tell me.


01:09:56.253 --> 01:09:57.787
How about it, baby brother?


01:10:00.224 --> 01:10:03.960
What happened in
the fieldhouse?


01:10:05.930 --> 01:10:07.430
Oh, God.
Matt, it's coming back.


01:10:07.432 --> 01:10:08.765
What happened, Simon?


01:10:08.767 --> 01:10:10.400
KITTY: Matt, it's coming back.


01:10:10.402 --> 01:10:12.468
MATT: I am not rowing


01:10:12.470 --> 01:10:15.905
until I know what's going on here.
Who my teammates are.


01:10:15.907 --> 01:10:17.941
How 'bout it, Bro?


01:10:17.943 --> 01:10:19.943
SIMON: Matt, this is really not
the time to talk about this.


01:10:19.945 --> 01:10:21.411
Okay.


01:10:21.413 --> 01:10:23.346
Oh, I'll take that as a yes.


01:10:26.250 --> 01:10:27.850
KITTY:
Matt, do you not get it?


01:10:27.852 --> 01:10:29.719
That thing is coming.
It's coming back.


01:10:29.721 --> 01:10:31.221
We need to paddle.


01:10:31.223 --> 01:10:33.990
SIMON: Matt, I say we vote.


01:10:36.393 --> 01:10:37.293
One last vote.


01:10:39.296 --> 01:10:42.765
Matt, you and me can swim
to that shore easy


01:10:42.767 --> 01:10:44.667
if the fish is distracted.


01:10:46.837 --> 01:10:49.706
Anything that happened,
Matt, it doesn't matter.


01:10:49.708 --> 01:10:52.008
I made a choice.
I was staying with you.


01:10:52.010 --> 01:10:53.977
I'll never leave now.
I'm sorry.


01:10:53.979 --> 01:10:57.580
I don't know why I did it.
But I will never leave now! Never!


01:11:01.318 --> 01:11:03.319
SIMON: Wasn't just
the fieldhouse, Matt.


01:11:03.321 --> 01:11:04.887
(CHUCKLES) No.


01:11:06.924 --> 01:11:07.790
Kitty could get pretty randy.


01:11:07.792 --> 01:11:08.825
MATT: Hey!


01:11:10.394 --> 01:11:11.794
Enough!


01:11:14.365 --> 01:11:16.399
You wanna vote, Simon?


01:11:16.401 --> 01:11:17.667
I vote you.


01:11:18.569 --> 01:11:20.303
What you did.


01:11:22.640 --> 01:11:23.906
I vote for you.


01:11:27.444 --> 01:11:28.611
(BOTH GRUNTING)


01:11:30.648 --> 01:11:31.648
Get off me!


01:11:31.650 --> 01:11:32.782
(MATT GRUNTING)


01:11:34.585 --> 01:11:36.552
SIMON: Get off, you tool!


01:11:36.554 --> 01:11:37.854
Shut up, asshole!


01:11:37.856 --> 01:11:39.016
She was coming with me, Matt!


01:11:42.860 --> 01:11:44.627
Matt, she was coming with me!


01:11:44.629 --> 01:11:46.763
No, Matt. Stop
listening to him. He's lying.


01:11:46.765 --> 01:11:48.665
She wasn't gonna
stay with you, Matt.


01:11:48.667 --> 01:11:50.366
(MATT SCREAMS)


01:11:51.935 --> 01:11:54.037
God, you two need to stop it!
You're going to tip us over.


01:11:54.039 --> 01:11:56.739
We're gonna tip over.
Stop it, now!


01:11:57.341 --> 01:11:58.441
Stop!


01:12:02.713 --> 01:12:03.946
What the hell, Matt?


01:12:03.948 --> 01:12:05.481
Yeah, I don't know.


01:12:05.483 --> 01:12:07.383
What? You gonna
kill me over some slut?


01:12:07.385 --> 01:12:09.052
Yeah. I don't know.


01:12:09.987 --> 01:12:11.654
Look at her, man.


01:12:11.989 --> 01:12:13.323
Look at her.


01:12:16.026 --> 01:12:17.727
She's playing
you like a fiddle.


01:12:22.566 --> 01:12:23.966
She came to me.


01:12:25.035 --> 01:12:26.736
When I got my scholarship.


01:12:28.372 --> 01:12:30.039
She thought you were
her ticket out of here


01:12:30.041 --> 01:12:31.641
and then she
realized it was me.


01:12:32.710 --> 01:12:34.811
She's a bitch, man.


01:12:34.813 --> 01:12:37.747
Matt, don't listen to him. Whatever
he says, just don't listen to him.


01:12:37.749 --> 01:12:39.716
He's a vicious asshole.
You haven't seen it, but, I have.


01:12:39.718 --> 01:12:40.616
I've seen things
that he's done.


01:12:40.618 --> 01:12:41.751
I vote Kitty.


01:12:48.525 --> 01:12:49.759
Me, too.


01:12:49.761 --> 01:12:51.094
Matt.


01:12:53.364 --> 01:12:54.664
That's it?


01:12:57.634 --> 01:12:59.135
So, what's it
gonna be, Kitty-cat?


01:13:01.572 --> 01:13:04.507
You gonna make this easy?
Go for a little swim?


01:13:05.576 --> 01:13:07.009
(SCREAMS)


01:13:07.011 --> 01:13:08.411
Or you want to do
it the hard way?


01:13:08.413 --> 01:13:10.646
Huh? Huh?


01:13:11.148 --> 01:13:12.482
(MATT YELLING)


01:13:12.484 --> 01:13:13.583
What's it gonna be, Kitty?


01:13:13.585 --> 01:13:14.951
What's it gonna be?


01:13:14.953 --> 01:13:16.419
(GRUNTING)


01:13:25.028 --> 01:13:27.964
You know, that's...
It is what I like about you, Simon.


01:13:27.966 --> 01:13:30.466
That animal part of you.


01:13:30.468 --> 01:13:32.068
Every goddamn time your brother


01:13:32.070 --> 01:13:34.404
was inside me,
I wanted it to be you.


01:13:34.406 --> 01:13:36.038
- You got the animal part right.
- Okay.


01:13:38.041 --> 01:13:40.109
You cheating whore!


01:13:40.111 --> 01:13:42.011
No! No! (SCREAMS)


01:13:45.949 --> 01:13:47.049
(KITTY COUGHING)


01:13:50.421 --> 01:13:51.421
(COUGHING)


01:13:54.024 --> 01:13:55.525
(SOBBING)


01:13:59.196 --> 01:14:02.565
Ow! Please,
Simon. Please, Simon. Please.


01:14:04.935 --> 01:14:06.536
You're done, Kitty.


01:14:09.606 --> 01:14:10.807
(KITTY SHUDDERING)


01:14:43.006 --> 01:14:44.207
Where did she go?


01:14:45.809 --> 01:14:47.043
I don't know.


01:14:52.916 --> 01:14:54.784
Should we swim for it?


01:14:54.786 --> 01:14:56.919
We paddle.
We're making progress.


01:14:56.921 --> 01:14:58.254
I mean,
we don't even know if that


01:14:58.256 --> 01:14:59.722
bitch is gonna
create a distraction...


01:14:59.724 --> 01:15:00.957
Shut up!


01:15:05.762 --> 01:15:07.263
What's the matter, Matty-Matt?
Huh?


01:15:08.565 --> 01:15:10.500
- You got remorse?
- Shut up!


01:15:13.937 --> 01:15:15.137
Okay.


01:15:15.939 --> 01:15:17.807
I'm sorry. All right.


01:15:24.982 --> 01:15:26.616
(GRUNTS)


01:15:28.886 --> 01:15:30.653
Oh, man, my head!


01:15:33.657 --> 01:15:34.590
Stop!


01:15:42.733 --> 01:15:43.733
SIMON: Ow!


01:15:46.236 --> 01:15:48.137
Matt, stop it! Hey!


01:15:56.713 --> 01:15:57.847
Simon!


01:16:02.119 --> 01:16:03.686
(ECHOING) Simon!


01:16:06.757 --> 01:16:08.257
Simon!


01:16:19.136 --> 01:16:21.203
Don't stop!
Don't stop your legs.


01:16:24.174 --> 01:16:25.575
(SIMON MOANS)


01:16:25.577 --> 01:16:26.617
(MATT SPEAKS INDISTINCTLY)


01:16:28.011 --> 01:16:29.946
MATT: I got you. I got you.


01:16:31.848 --> 01:16:34.951
I swear to God I can see
headlights on the shore.


01:16:36.787 --> 01:16:39.355
There's someone there
and they're gonna help us.


01:16:41.658 --> 01:16:43.659
All we gotta do is
just get to shore.


01:16:45.195 --> 01:16:46.762
Matt.


01:16:46.764 --> 01:16:47.964
Can you swim, bro?


01:16:47.966 --> 01:16:50.132
What? What?


01:16:50.134 --> 01:16:52.802
Come on. Can you swim, bro?


01:16:52.804 --> 01:16:54.203
- What?
- I'm pretty beat.


01:16:54.205 --> 01:16:56.172
- What?
- I'm pretty beat.


01:16:56.174 --> 01:16:57.673
Come on. Come on.


01:17:02.846 --> 01:17:04.080
Help!


01:17:05.649 --> 01:17:06.716
Help.


01:17:09.786 --> 01:17:10.953
SIMON: Final vote.


01:17:14.257 --> 01:17:15.391
(MATT SCREAMING)


01:17:28.872 --> 01:17:30.272
(SCREAMING)


01:19:17.047 --> 01:19:18.447
Oh, my God.


01:19:53.550 --> 01:19:56.385
It's all make-believe,
isn't it?


01:19:56.387 --> 01:19:58.053
It's all make-believe,
isn't it?


01:20:25.348 --> 01:20:27.049
(GASPING)


01:20:28.385 --> 01:20:30.186
(COUGHING)


01:20:35.192 --> 01:20:37.026
Kitty! Wait!


01:20:37.028 --> 01:20:40.162
No, no... No.


01:20:40.164 --> 01:20:41.430
You killed Matt.


01:20:41.432 --> 01:20:42.598
Wait! Wait!


01:20:42.600 --> 01:20:46.602
You killed Matt. I saw you.
I saw you kill Matt. (SOBBING)


01:20:48.305 --> 01:20:49.271
How did you make it?


01:20:50.373 --> 01:20:51.941
You killed your own brother.


01:20:55.045 --> 01:20:56.412
Did Johnny plan all this?


01:20:58.348 --> 01:20:59.415
You're crazy.


01:21:00.917 --> 01:21:03.085
Please. Please,
Simon. Please, let me go.


01:21:06.289 --> 01:21:08.257
No one ever
understood me like you did.


01:21:10.060 --> 01:21:12.428
I do. I do understand you.


01:21:12.430 --> 01:21:13.670
But in the end,
you picked Matt.


01:21:15.232 --> 01:21:18.100
No,
Simon, we could be together.


01:21:18.102 --> 01:21:20.903
We could be...
We could be so good together.


01:21:20.905 --> 01:21:22.371
Together.


01:21:22.373 --> 01:21:23.973
It's the story of my life.


01:21:42.459 --> 01:21:44.226
(MUFFLED SCREAMS)


01:21:50.166 --> 01:21:53.135
(SOBBING)


01:21:53.137 --> 01:21:54.536
(CHOKING)


01:21:56.273 --> 01:21:57.573
(COUGHING)


01:22:22.432 --> 01:22:25.701
Never. Never. Never!


01:22:36.046 --> 01:22:36.712
(GRUNTS)


01:22:50.427 --> 01:22:52.394
You will never
leave this place.


01:23:17.354 --> 01:23:19.021
- Are you...
- Johnny's friend.


01:23:20.457 --> 01:23:21.991
Yeah, from before.


01:23:23.259 --> 01:23:25.260
Where's Johnny?


01:23:26.563 --> 01:23:27.629
Uh...


01:23:31.735 --> 01:23:33.302
Sir, there's been
a terrible accident.


01:23:35.238 --> 01:23:40.576
That boy, he was very kind.
Like his grandpa.


01:23:41.611 --> 01:23:44.146
I've known his
grandpa all my life.


01:23:44.148 --> 01:23:47.449
Sir, you have no idea what
happened. The nightmare.


01:23:47.451 --> 01:23:49.752
My brother and
my friends are...


01:23:53.056 --> 01:23:55.124
Sir, I tried to save
them and I couldn't.


01:23:55.126 --> 01:23:58.494
Oh, is that what happened?


01:23:58.496 --> 01:24:01.730
Sir, there is a monster.
There is a giant fish.


01:24:01.732 --> 01:24:04.633
I heard about it when I was a kid,
but nobody believed it.


01:24:04.635 --> 01:24:08.337
You kids,
you don't believe anything anymore.


01:24:08.339 --> 01:24:11.306
Sir, I don't think you understand
what I've been through.


01:24:12.108 --> 01:24:14.043
Oh, yeah, I do.


01:24:15.512 --> 01:24:17.079
I've been watching you.


01:24:17.081 --> 01:24:18.380
(RECORDING
PLAYING INDISTINCTLY)


01:24:20.216 --> 01:24:21.817
How did you find that?


01:24:21.819 --> 01:24:24.553
Washed up on the shore.


01:24:24.555 --> 01:24:27.656
Like so many things
better left in the lake.


01:24:29.793 --> 01:24:32.828
Whatever's on that camera
does not tell the whole story.


01:24:32.830 --> 01:24:36.165
Oh, you're such a big shot,
you and your brother.


01:24:36.167 --> 01:24:40.269
Your father
practically owns the town.


01:24:40.271 --> 01:24:43.572
I guess you thought you
could get away with anything.


01:24:43.574 --> 01:24:47.376
Sir, you have... You have no
idea what you're talking about.


01:24:47.378 --> 01:24:49.278
Sir, I need to get help.


01:24:49.280 --> 01:24:53.282
I guess you thought this
would be the end of it.


01:24:54.417 --> 01:24:55.551
What are you doing?


01:24:56.719 --> 01:24:58.487
- Don't move.
- (COCKS GUN)


01:24:58.489 --> 01:24:59.455
What is going on?


01:25:00.356 --> 01:25:02.791
What the hell are you doing?


01:25:02.793 --> 01:25:06.595
I don't think the lake is
finished with you yet, son.


01:25:06.597 --> 01:25:09.431
Sir, please. Please stop.


01:25:09.433 --> 01:25:11.433
(SOBS) Please stop.


01:25:11.435 --> 01:25:17.840
Maybe you'd better move back into
the water and try your luck again.


01:25:19.476 --> 01:25:23.312
No, no. No! I am not
going back out there.


01:25:23.314 --> 01:25:24.613
(GUNSHOT)


01:25:24.615 --> 01:25:26.281
No! No!


01:25:26.283 --> 01:25:27.483
- (GUNSHOT)
- Ah!


01:25:27.485 --> 01:25:29.518
(SCREAMS) Ah!


01:25:32.489 --> 01:25:34.456
(BAWLING)


01:25:37.660 --> 01:25:38.827
(SCREAMS)


01:25:41.898 --> 01:25:45.334
Stop. Please, stop. (SOBBING)


01:25:45.835 --> 01:25:47.369
Please stop!


01:25:52.642 --> 01:25:53.909
(COUGHING)


01:25:53.911 --> 01:25:55.210
(GUNSHOT)


01:26:05.221 --> 01:26:06.488
(SIMON SCREAMING)


01:26:06.490 --> 01:26:08.690
No! No!


01:26:14.197 --> 01:26:19.935
No! No! No! No! No! No!


01:26:20.436 --> 01:26:21.803
No!


01:26:22.472 --> 01:26:25.440
No. No! No!


01:26:25.442 --> 01:26:27.576
No! No!


01:26:28.645 --> 01:26:31.180
(SCREAMING)

